  "algorithm": "Search only the gap above a verified first staff; require a thin horizontal line and descending left hook, OCR the number cell, coalesce collinear proposals, then require an adjacent 1→2 pair. The first bracket must have a real descending right hook. Adjacent-system pairing requires end-of-system/right-side first bracket followed immediately by a left-side second bracket. All source rectangles remain unchanged pixel copies.",
  "ambiguity": "Fast Vision reads three Brahms printed 1 glyphs as literal I at 0.5 confidence. Evidence remains literal and ambiguous. It is accepted as a first-position candidate only with a closed bracket and an adjacent exact 2 candidate. No guessed numeral is drawn or transcribed into the score.",
